From c0c3203ae22bae17d7e805f592fd0b96c85b89f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agnimon <agnimon.codex1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:45:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Preserve raw BX values and verify reset evidence for
 recovery

Add the raw capture mode that retains decoded quarantined and non-finite observations without changing legacy decoding. Report exact accepted write counts and require the complete RESET token including CRC and CR. INIT, configuration, ROM enable and TSTART still belong to the existing command owner before synchronization can be restored. Generated ndicapiExport.h remains a build output.
